<div class="prose-page" style="padding: 0 0 24px;">
  <h2>How to use this icebreaker generator</h2>
  <p>Leave every category unchecked to pull from the full mix, or select one or more categories — <strong>Work</strong>, <strong>Remote</strong>, <strong>Fun</strong>, <strong>Deep</strong>, or <strong>Kid-friendly</strong> — to narrow the pool. Hit "Generate" for a new question any time; it won't repeat the one you just saw. Use "Copy" to paste the question into Slack, Zoom chat, or a meeting agenda, or "Share" to send it directly from your phone.</p>
  <p>Looking for a themed list instead of a random generator? Check out our guide to <a href="/blog/icebreaker-questions-for-work-meetings/">50 icebreaker questions for work meetings</a> or <a href="/blog/icebreaker-games-for-remote-teams/">icebreaker games built for remote teams</a>.</p>
